Chora — bundled font notices
============================

The TV typeface is selected at build time by the `fonts` flavor dimension. Both flavors
provide the same four resource names (`res/font/chora_display_regular/medium/semibold/bold`),
so application code never branches on the flavor.

SF Pro (sfpro flavor)
---------------------
SF Pro is a trademark of Apple Inc. It is bundled in the `sfpro` flavor at the project
owner's discretion (see apple-music-tv-spec.md §14.1); it is not covered by this
repository's Apache-2.0 license. The `foss` flavor ships an open font instead.

Place the licensed files in `app/src/sfpro/res/font/` — see `app/src/sfpro/FONTS.md` for the
exact names. Until they are present, the `sfpro` flavor also renders the open fallback
below, so a build passing is not proof that SF Pro is bundled. Record the source and
SHA-256 of each added file in this section before shipping.

